=\"bottom\"` with controlled state for a bottom sheet pattern. Compose a\n`CloseButton` for the dismiss affordance."},"642":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-20","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#placements","content":"The drawer slides in from whichever edge you set with `placement`."},"643":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-21","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#nested-popover","content":"Popovers rendered inside a drawer stay open without dismissing the drawer."},"644":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-22","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#no-escape-dismiss","content":"Use `isKeyboardDismissDisabled` to prevent the drawer from being dismissed by the escape key."},"645":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-23","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#scrollable-content","content":"When the content is taller than the drawer, the `Content` region scrolls while the title row\nstays pinned."},"646":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-24","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"Key"},"647":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-25","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"Action"},"648":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-26","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"`Escape`"},"649":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-27","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"Close the drawer (unless `isKeyboardDismissDisabled`)"},"650":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-28","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"`Tab`"},"651":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer